# --registry is the last word: no value, so the registry of the working directory
$ skills status --registry
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
Total:  4
Core:   1
Custom: 2
Status: OK
--- stderr ---

# --registry is followed by a flag: the flag is its value
$ skills status --registry --manifest x
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: reading registry "--manifest": open --manifest: no such file or directory

# --registry is given the empty word
$ skills status --registry 
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: reading registry "": open : no such file or directory

